<title>USA: Banc One Corp Q4 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Banc One Corp Q4 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.85		    $0.77</p>
<p> Net			369,797		  336,846</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 430,992		  431,746</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Provision for loan and lease losses was $244.9 million in Q4 1996 and $165.9 million in Q4 1995.  </p>
<p>		   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		  $3.23		    $2.91</p>
<p> Net		 1,426,533		 1,277,863</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  436,927		  433,323</p>
<p>NOTE: Provision for loan and lease losses was $788.1 million in 1996 and $457.5 million in 1995.</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>First Call had put Wall Street analysts' consensus estimates for the 1996 fourth quarter at $0.83 a share.</p>
</text>
